//! family; `try_intercept` is the dispatcher.
//!
//! Covered intercepts:
//! - `list_len(xs)` (saga 29 step 002)
//! - `ok(v)` / `err(v)` Result constructors (saga 29 step 012)
//! - `is_ok` / `is_err` / `unwrap` / `err_message` / `unwrap_or`
